<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Intelligence Network</title>

<style>

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background:#0F2D22;
    color:#F3EBDD;
    line-height:1.7;
}


/* HERO */

.hero{
    padding:80px 20px;
    text-align:center;
    background:
    linear-gradient(
    180deg,
    #194936,
    #0F2D22
    );
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(243,235,221,.2);
}

.hero h1{
    font-size:3rem;
    color:#D8B08C;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero p{
    max-width:850px;
    margin:auto;
    font-size:1.1rem;
}


.button{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:30px;
    padding:14px 30px;
    background:#4B2E1E;
    color:#F3EBDD;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:30px;
    font-weight:bold;
}


/* MAIN */

.container{
    max-width:1150px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:50px 20px;
}


h2{
    color:#D8B08C;
    margin-bottom:25px;
    font-size:2rem;
    border-left:5px solid #4B2E1E;
    padding-left:15px;
}


section{
    margin-bottom:60px;
}


/* CARDS */

.grid{

    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:
    repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));

    gap:25px;
}


.card{

    background:#173A2B;
    padding:25px;
    border-radius:15px;
    border:1px solid rgba(216,176,140,.25);

    transition:.3s;

}


.card:hover{

    transform:translateY(-8px);
    border-color:#D8B08C;

}


.card h3{

    color:#D8B08C;
    margin-bottom:10px;

}


.card p{

    opacity:.9;

}



/* INFORMATION PYRAMID */


.level{

    background:#183D2D;
    padding:30px;
    margin:20px 0;
    border-left:5px solid #4B2E1E;
    border-radius:10px;

}


.level h3{

    color:#D8B08C;

}



/* CHECKLIST */


.checklist{

    background:#173A2B;
    padding:30px;
    border-radius:15px;

}


.checklist div{

    padding:12px;
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(243,235,221,.1);

}


.checklist span{

    color:#35F2D0;
    font-weight:bold;

}



/* FRAMEWORK */


.framework{

display:grid;
grid-template-columns:
repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));

gap:25px;

}


.framework-box{

background:#143326;
padding:25px;
border-radius:12px;

}


.framework-box h3{

color:#D8B08C;

}



/* FOOTER */


footer{

background:#082017;
padding:60px 20px;
text-align:center;

}


footer h2{

border:none;

}


@media(max-width:700px){

.hero h1{

font-size:2.2rem;

}


h2{

font-size:1.5rem;

}

}


</style>

</head>


<body>


<header class="hero">

<h1>The Intelligence Network</h1>

<p>
Your future decisions are shaped by the information you repeatedly consume.
Build a personal intelligence system that improves your thinking,
increases your awareness, and helps you recognize opportunities faster.
</p>

<a class="button" href="#system">
Build Your Knowledge System
</a>

</header>



<div class="container">


<section>

<h2>What Is an Intelligence Network?</h2>

<p>

An Intelligence Network is a personal ecosystem of knowledge.
It includes books, experiences, mentors, research, conversations,
skills, observations, and ideas that continuously improve your ability
to understand the world.

</p>

<p>

High performers do not simply consume more information.
They create systems that filter, organize, and apply information.

</p>

</section>




<section id="system">


<h2>The Intelligence Growth System</h2>


<div class="grid">


<div class="card">

<h3>1. Capture</h3>

<p>
Collect valuable ideas from books, conversations, articles,
experiences, and observations.
</p>

</div>


<div class="card">

<h3>2. Organize</h3>

<p>
Connect information into categories, patterns,
and useful frameworks.
</p>

</div>


<div class="card">

<h3>3. Apply</h3>

<p>
Turn knowledge into action through projects,
experiments, and decisions.
</p>

</div>


<div class="card">

<h3>4. Review</h3>

<p>
Study results and improve your thinking process.
</p>

</div>


</div>

</section>




<section>

<h2>The Information Pyramid</h2>


<div class="level">

<h3>Foundation: Daily Learning</h3>

<p>
Read, listen, study, and observe every day.
Small consistent learning creates long-term advantages.
</p>

</div>


<div class="level">

<h3>Middle: Deep Understanding</h3>

<p>
Study topics beyond headlines.
Learn history, causes, systems, and opposing viewpoints.
</p>

</div>


<div class="level">

<h3>Top: Original Thinking</h3>

<p>
Combine ideas from different fields to create new solutions,
strategies, and opportunities.
</p>

</div>


</section>





<section>


<h2>Information Diet Rules</h2>


<div class="framework">


<div class="framework-box">

<h3>Consume Less Noise</h3>

<p>
Avoid endless information that creates awareness without action.
</p>

</div>



<div class="framework-box">

<h3>Increase Depth</h3>

<p>
One deeply understood concept is more valuable than hundreds
of shallow opinions.
</p>

</div>



<div class="framework-box">

<h3>Study Systems</h3>

<p>
Learn how money, organizations, technology, psychology,
and society operate.
</p>

</div>


</div>


</section>





<section>


<h2>Daily Intelligence Checklist....  Upgrade List</h2>


<div class="checklist">


<div>
<span>✓</span>
Read or study something valuable
</div>


<div>
<span>✓</span>
Write down important ideas
</div>


<div>
<span>✓</span>
Question an assumption
</div>


<div>
<span>✓</span>
Practice a useful skill
</div>


<div>
<span>✓</span>
Review what you learned
</div>


<div>
<span>✓</span>
Apply one idea in real life
</div>


</div>


</section>





<section>


<h2>Knowledge Compounds Over Time</h2>


<p>

A single idea may appear insignificant.
However, ideas connected together create frameworks.
Frameworks improve decisions.
Better decisions create better outcomes.

</p>


<p>

The advantage does not come from knowing everything.
The advantage comes from building a mind that learns,
adapts, and improves continuously.

</p>


</section>



</div>



<footer>

<h2>Create Your Intelligence Advantage</h2>

<p>

The quality of your future depends on the quality of information
you allow into your mind today.

</p>


</footer>



</body>
</html>
